“property developer” means an entrepreneur whopromotes any project in the construction industry,specially in the housing sector which are eitherphysically or conceptually developed by the gainof inputs of lands, land ownership, financing,marketing or any other required expertise;

“qualified person” is a person who is competent incarrying out designing, preparation of requiredcontract documents and supervision of anyidentified construction works, whose name isincluded in the Register of Qualified Persons;

“supervision” means to ensure that the engineering andarchitectural concepts and judgments incorporatedin the design are properly adhered to in anyconstruction work.

