BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:—

1.This Act may be cited as the BodhirajaramaEducational and Cultural Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. 28 of 2014.

Preamble.

Short title.

