(h)to borrow such sums of money as may be necessaryfor the purpose of discharging its functions ;

(i)to appoint, employ, remunerate and exercisedisciplinary control over, and dismiss such officersand servants as are necessary for the discharge ofthe functions of the Agency under this Act ;

(j)to charge fees for the services and assistanceprovided by the Agency ; and

