(2) Any expense incurred by any member, officer or anyservant of the Board in any suit or prosecution brought by oragainst such person before any court in respect of any act oromission which is done or purported to be done by suchperson in good faith for the purpose of carrying out theprovisions of this Act shall, if the court holds that such act oromission was done in good faith, be paid out of the Fund ofthe Agency, unless such expenses are recovered by suchmember, officer or servant in such suit or prosecution.

